Use the deep Claude model for architecture, non-trivial implementation, security, money, legal, client-facing text, external sends, production deploys, merge/publish verification, and ambiguous judgment calls.
If the active model is wrong, state the exact model switch supported by this Claude Code install. SCWAP can advise; do not claim to switch silently.
